From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 21:54:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove feedback crate + zed_actions::feedback module

- Delete crates/feedback.
- main.rs: drop feedback::init call.
- app_menus.rs: drop File Bug Report / Request Feature / Email Us /
  Zed Repository menu items (zed-industries-specific URLs).
- workspace.rs: drop the 'File an Issue' button on database load
  failure; the toast just announces the failure now.
- zed_actions: remove the feedback module.

Other in-repo references to the word 'feedback' (edit_prediction
inline ratings, mercury prediction-rating endpoint, etc.) are
distinct subsystems and are addressed by later patches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
